[h1]Custom Fonts - Forked[/h1]

Choose the fonts you want for RimWorld's UI and world map. This mod focuses on flexible font replacement using installed fonts, bundled fonts, or your own font files.

ゲームのUIやワールドマップのフォントを自由に変更するためのMODです。システムフォント・同梱フォント・任意のフォントファイルを利用できます。
게임 UI와 월드맵 폰트를 자유롭게 변경하는 데 집중하는 모드입니다. 시스템 폰트, 번들 폰트 또는 직접 지정한 폰트 파일을 사용할 수 있습니다.

A fork of Custom Fonts by nmkj (nmkj_yuri), maintained by zcubekr.

[b]RimWorld 1.4–1.7. Requires [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2009463077]Harmony[/url].[/b]

[h2]RimWorld 1.7 Support[/h2]

RimWorld 1.7 introduces substantial engine and font rendering changes. Support for 1.7 remains [b]experimental[/b].

[b]Issues and verification status[/b]
[list]
  [*][b]Platform testing:[/b] Tested on macOS and Windows. Linux and Steam Deck testing is still limited; full Linux verification remains pending.
  [*][b]Text fields in other UI mods:[/b] Styles that independently override an existing font's size can still display text at a different size because of the 1.7 engine's input rendering behavior.
[/list]

[url=https://github.com/ZCube/rw-customfonts/issues]Track or report 1.7 issues on GitHub[/url].

[h2]Features[/h2]

[list]
  [*]Separate fonts for UI text sizes and world map labels, with a uniform UI option.
  [*]Font scaling, vertical position, search and preview.
  [*]Load TTF, OTF and TTC files or folders without OS installation.
  [*]Ordered fallback fonts for missing characters.
  [*]System and user font discovery, including Linux and Steam Deck host font folders.
[/list]

[h2]Usage[/h2]

Open [b]Options → Mod settings → Custom Fonts[/b] to choose fonts. Add your own files or folders under [b]etc → Font files and folders[/b], then click [b]Refresh font list / apply search options[/b].

[h2]Fallback Fonts[/h2]

Keep your preferred font while using other fonts for characters it does not contain. The primary font takes priority; missing characters use your fallback list from top to bottom, followed by the game's automatic fallbacks.

[list]
  [*]In a Tiny, Small, Medium or World tab, click [b]+[/b] beside a font to add it as a fallback. Use the arrows to reorder entries and [b]×[/b] to remove them.
  [*]Each tab has its own list. With [b]Uniform UI Fonts[/b] enabled, the Medium list also applies to Tiny and Small; World remains separate.
  [*][b]Merge another tab (union)[/b] copies another tab's list, or all tab lists, into the current list without duplicate entries.
[/list]

[h2]Bundled Fonts[/h2]

[list]
  [*]Sarasa UI J Regular v1.0.42
  [*]Sarasa UI K Regular v1.0.42
[/list]

Only the fonts listed above are bundled. Additional fonts are not included; use fonts available on your system or supply your own font files.

